h","text":"そーしーて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は久しぶりに私服でものっけてみよっかな？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーらよっと！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青のニット帽は最近買った❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりあみ青が好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BIGBANGのなかでもBLUEって曲が好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ。\n最近毎日お稽古で演技が出来て幸せ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返すーおん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレートは\nミルク派？ホワイト派？ビター派？\n答えてくれると嬉しいです(*^▽^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはやっぱりホワイト派かなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビターも嫌いじゃないよ？？ビター。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみは男性にどんな服を着てもらいたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザ 爽やか！！って感じも好きだし、\nKーpopっぽい派手な服装も好きっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph